         MACRO                                                          00010000
&NAME    HEPILOG ,                                                      00020000
.* *****************************************************************    00030000
.* *                                                                    00040000
.* *     Generate the VM/CE standard module ending                      00050000
.* *                                                                    00060000
.* *****************************************************************    00070000
         GBLC  &HSECT                                                   00080000
&HSECT   CSECT ,                       Resume module scope              00090000
         ORG   ,                       Reset location counter to end    00100000
&NAME    DS    0D                      Round up to double word          00110000
H@@@END  EQU   *                       Mark end of module               00120000
         END   ,                                                        00130000
         MEND                                                           00140000
